flowchart TD
  A[HUD user selects +15 or -15] --> B{Video loaded & duration/position valid?}
  B -- No --> C[Show Seek unavailable]
  B -- Yes --> D[Read latest confirmed position]
  D --> E[Compute target = position + delta]
  E --> F[Clamp target to seekable media interval]
  F --> G{Seek already in progress?}
  G -- Yes --> H[Debounce or queue newest intent]
  G -- No --> I[Issue native Video seek request]
  I --> J[Show +15s or -15s HUD feedback]
  J --> K{Position update / timeout?}
  K -- Updated --> L[Refresh progress bar and controls]
  K -- Timeout / Error --> M[Show seek error and recover]
  H --> K
